cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Microclaw in your work, please cite the preprint below."
title: Microclaw
abstract: >-
  An AI agent for Micro-Manager microscopy control. Describe your acquisition
  protocol in plain language; Microclaw translates it into Pycro-Manager tool
  calls while the GUI responds in real time. Acquisition routines can be
  compiled to standalone Pycro-Manager scripts for re-use outside of the agent.
type: software
